{"version":1,"content":"<p>天文台表示，本港周六（17日）漸轉多雲，早晚有一兩陣雨，日間短暫時間有陽光，氣溫介乎27至30°C 。</p><p>吹和緩東風，風勢間中清勁。</p><p>展望重陽節（18日）早上大致多雲，有一兩陣微雨，稍後至下周初漸轉天晴乾燥，下周中期日間炎熱。</p><p>（天文台）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T14:20:30.133037+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T13:49:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T05:17:58.137326+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T14:17:38.508348+00:00","content_hash":"aba746c580d52f6dfc89bad3372eee7345d825a4f69803ab8f3e58f47249c338","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}